    {
      "name": "Pinning Chomp",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The gibtas's last action was a Bouncing Slam and the gibtas successfully Shoved the target</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The gibtas attempts to Trip the target of its Bouncing Slam, then makes a jaws Strike against the target. The Trip and Strike both count against the gibtas's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks.</p>",
